  "id": "cocaine-dependence",
  "term": "cocaine dependence",
  "definition": "Cocaine dependence is a condition that develops from cocaine use in which a person’s psychological and social functioning becomes impaired, sometimes along with physical changes. It is marked by compulsive behavior aimed at obtaining the drug.",
